The launcher's look follows CleanMyTV (https://github.com/Supopo/CleanMyTV, MIT licence, Copyright (c)
2026 Gathin): the dock band, tile sizes, glow, motion values and the colour sampling in
launcher/src/dev/lite/home/Art.java (vividColor, adapted from its AppAdapter) are based on its design.

ad-blocker/ does not include any blocklist. Its build (ad-blocker/tools/build_blocklist.py) downloads
public lists from HaGeZi, OISD, StevenBlack, AdGuard and 1Hosts at build time, each under its own
licence, and merges them on your machine.

